24
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,810
Brother Wang,

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,570
the teams we sent to the other countries are gradually returning.

26
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:06,410
This war was prepared meticulously.

27
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:09,210
It was beyond our imagination.

28
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:12,810
We asked eight rank 4 cultivations countries for help,

29
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:15,210
but almost all of them refused.

30
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:19,050
Even when our envoys were recieved,

31
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:22,410
they did not agree to send any troops.

32
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:25,170
Only a country which has been a friend for generations

33
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:27,770
told us out of sympathy

34
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:30,730
that their ancestors had made a deal

35
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:34,330
and issued the order that no one is to help the Four Sect Alliance.

36
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,970
How can Xue Yue, a rank 4 country,

37
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:39,450
have such an influence ?

38
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:43,850
The real reason for this war is actually

39
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,770
a woman from Xue Yue.

40
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,210
This woman

41
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:50,090
has only cultivated for 100 years.

42
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,650
She has never consumed any pill

43
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:55,130
and already has reached Soul Formation.

44
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:56,850
It's rumored that

45
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:59,810
she has a never seen before 5 elements constitution.

46
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:02,690
She was born with 5 elemental spirits guarding her.

47
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,130
Now she controls them.

48
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:07,930
She is the most talented person born on Suzaku in the past 10 000 years.

49
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,050
This woman,

50
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,850
has attracted the attention of the rank 6 country of Suzaku

51
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:15,930
which invited her to join them to rule the planet.

52
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:20,210
She only set a single condition to her joining Suzaku.

53
00:03:20,890 --> 00:03:24,210
Which is to raise Xue Yue to a rank 5 country

54
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,570
and have them leave

55
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:28,130
the barren North.

56
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,730
The place she chose

57
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:33,530
was the Four Sect Alliance.

58
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:34,910
Four Sect Alliance

59
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,330
On top of that,

60
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,050
Xue Yue's Rain Cauldron

61
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:40,610
suddenly appeared in the Four Sect Alliance.

62
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,810
There will be

63
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,370
many powerful Soul Formation cultivators in this war.

64
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:47,290
My cultivation is too low.

65
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,250
If I really need to fight them,

66
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,930
my only chance is to place one last restriction on this flag

67
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,330
to summon a tribulation.

68
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:03,730
1 year later

69
00:04:08,170 --> 00:04:09,930
Within 80 feet of the Sky-Locking Nail,

70
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,270
using artifacts is forbidden.

71
00:04:11,050 --> 00:04:11,910
Pay attention !

72
00:04:11,490 --> 00:04:12,780
By order of the sect leader,

73
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,700
take the Green Jade Bell of the Water Ink Sect,

74
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:16,240
and use it as the center of the formation.

75
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:17,050
Fellow cultivators,

76
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,260
build the formation with me.

77
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:19,330
Yes !

78
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:23,450
Master,

79
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,090
the dragon soul is in place.

80
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:26,610
It can be woken up at any time.

81
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,700
They have arrived.

82
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,650
Fellow cultivators of Xue Yue,

83
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,970
since you are here for the Rain Cauldron,

84
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,170
it's right here.

85
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:03,530
Can our two countries call a truce

86
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,210
and let the mortals

87
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,970
survive ?

88
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:07,730
Kill !

89
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,570
Kill !

90
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,370
Kill !

91
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,410
This land

92
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:12,010
now belongs to Xue Yue.

93
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,450
The Rain Cauldron

94
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,250
also belongs to Xue Yue.

95
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:16,970
The mortals

96
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,530
will also belong to Xue Yue if they survive.

97
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:21,170
Kill them now !

98
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,530
This land

99
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:25,210
is our new Xue Yue.

100
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:02,890
The cultivators of Xue Yue use this snow for their spells.

101
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,570
That's why

102
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,610
it snowed for years...

103
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,590
Humans

104
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,130
cannot live without a home.

105
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,330
And we, cultivators,

106
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,610
are also human.

107
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,530
If we want to save our homeland,

108
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,250
then today,

109
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:20,210
we will fight to the death !

110
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,290
Mo Shan
Water Ink Sect Elder
Middle stage Soul Formation

111
00:06:30,350 --> 00:06:31,290
Wu Huichu
Black Soul Sect Elder
Late stage Soul Formation

112
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,250
The 5 elemental spirits ?

113
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,370
Attack !

114
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:56,610
I heard that the 5 elemental spirits are all Soul Formation.

115
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:59,730
I can finally meet them today.

116
00:06:56,670 --> 00:06:59,930
Qing Fu
Green Wood Sect Elder
Middle stage Soul Formation

117
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:44,170
Both sides are still preserving their power.

118
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,970
The Ice Towers !

119
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,130
That means Soul Formation elders have arrived

120
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,690
36 Soul Formation cultivators...

121
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,250
4 of them are Late stage.

122
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:21,410
Xue Yue sent all of their elders on this battlefield...

123
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:59,330
Zhou Yun
Black Soul Sect Great Elder
Late stage Soul Formation

124
00:08:56,200 --> 00:09:00,290
I'm Zhou Yun of the Black Soul Sect.

125
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:04,890
May I ask if you are Xue Yue's Red Butterfly ?

126
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,370
So it's fellow cultivator Zhou Yun,

127
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:12,970
one of the 9 Late stage Soul Formation of the Four Sect Alliance.

128
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,290
I admire you.

129
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:20,090
The Nine-Sons killing formation is very powerful,

130
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:23,650
it can definitely kill anyone below Soul Transformation.

131
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,410
Although this formation is strong,

132
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:28,840
it will consume Seniors' lifespan.

133
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:31,170
If we lose our country,

134
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:32,250
our sects

135
00:09:32,170 --> 00:09:33,650
and our lives,

136
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,930
what will the point of having preserved our lifespan be ?

137
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:40,890
The key to this battle is Red Butterfly.

138
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,810
Once this woman dies,

139
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:46,130
Xue Yue will lose the support of the country of Suzaku.

140
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:49,210
Then we will have a chance to win the war.

141
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:54,010
Xue Yue could not have overlooked this strategy of yours.

142
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,650
There might be dozens

143
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:57,570
of Soul Formation cultivators

144
00:09:57,350 --> 00:09:59,610
laying in ambush around Red Butterfly

145
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:01,090
to save her no matter what.

146
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,610
What should we do ?

147
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:05,810
We need to force their Soul Formation cultivators

148
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:08,410
to put all their efforts into the battlefield.

149
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,770
No matter what it takes.

150
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:13,210
Fellow cultivators,

151
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,210
let's fight !

152
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:22,970
Lifespan sacrifice !

153
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,610
Burning away your lifespans ?

154
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,490
Futile !

155
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:42,250
The damage is spread out !?

156
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:46,410
Nine-Sons killing formation !

157
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,370
Rise !

158
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,650
Our combined strength

159
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:56,930
can kill you !

160
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,970
They killed Red Butterfly ?

161
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:41,170
This seemed too easy to be real.

162
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,930
Red Butterfly is dead !

163
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:54,050
The Four Sect Alliance will not give up its land !

164
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,570
We won't give up our land !

165
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,850
Kill them !

166
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:34,850
Guardian Azure Dragon,

167
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:37,410
protect our Four Sect Alliance !

168
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:40,490
So the reason his status is so high

169
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:43,090
despite only being Nascent Soul

170
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,930
is because he has the bloodline

171
00:12:44,710 --> 00:12:46,250
of the Azure Dragon.

172
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,970
Red Butterfly is dead,

173
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,690
the 5 elemental spirits are weakened.

174
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,970
My fellow cultivators, do your best to fight !

175
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,850
Don't let that tiger escape !

176
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,410
Seal !

177
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:43,220
The elements of the Heaven Defying Bead are incomplete.

178
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:46,010
Maybe I can absorb this Soul Formation earth spirit.

179
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:49,010
It's worth trying !

180
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:02,170
Where can you escape to ?

181
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:45,730
As expected,

182
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,370
even if the earth spirit is weakened,

183
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:50,010
I can't underestimate it.

184
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:53,730
Damn beast !

185
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,970
Bold of you !

186
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,390
Junior is a disciple of the White Cloud Sect.

187
00:15:17,190 --> 00:15:19,090
I am Qing Song's disciple.

188
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:21,090
My master ordered me to take the earth spirit.

189
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:23,050
Senior, don't blame me.

190
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,370
It's really Qing Song's Passage of Time Domain.

191
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,690
White Cloud Sect...

192
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,840
If that Soul Formation cultivator were to act,

193
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:38,610
I would be dead without a doubt.

194
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:41,170
The restriction flag was damaged.

195
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:44,290
Snatching food from the tiger's mouth

196
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:45,650
is too risky.

197
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,890
What's this ?

198
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:24,530
This ice sculpture is almost impossible to detect with Divine Sense.

199
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:27,250
It seems that even the Soul Formation cultivators

200
00:16:27,520 --> 00:16:29,250
didn't notice it.

201
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:32,650
The power of ice contained in it is tremendous...

202
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:35,330
It must be a part of a formation.

203
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:46,050
This ice formation covers the whole Four Sect Alliance.

204
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,370
This war

205
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:51,170
is far from over.

206
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:55,890
A gigantic ice formation ?

207
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,810
This is...

208
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:04,850
a formation ?

209
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:06,970
Xue Yue came well prepared...

210
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:07,930
Everyone, be careful !

211
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:31,110
This is bad...

212
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,700
Lord Envoy,

213
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,090
the country of Suzaku promised

214
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,850
that they would help me once.

215
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:52,330
So now...

216
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:56,410
Please kill this Azure Dragon !

217
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:59,410
Red Butterfly
Xue Yue's genius Dao Child
Peak Late stage Soul Formation

218
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:18,410
I've had my share of wounds,

219
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:18,410
now I want to fight back.

220
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:21,970
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

221
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:27,890
that's blocking all my hopes

222
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:27,890
for life ?

223
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:33,650
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

224
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:33,650
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

225
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:37,050
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

226
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:43,050
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

227
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:43,050
out of reach.

228
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:48,530
Immortals

229
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:48,530
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

230
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:52,570
Renegades

231
00:18:49,320 --> 00:18:52,570
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

232
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:56,410
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

233
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:56,410
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

234
00:18:56,400 --> 00:19:00,530
because I don't see the harm in that.

235
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:08,330
My new body opens its eyes

236
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:08,330
and awakens from its dream.

237
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:15,890
I have overcome many trials

238
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:15,890
to get this body back.

239
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:23,530
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

240
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:23,530
I can still see.

241
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:32,890
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

242
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:32,890
by my own hands.

243
00:20:03,520 --> 00:20:09,730
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

244
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:09,730
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

245
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:17,290
With a flick of a finger,

246
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:17,290
only my indomitable heart remains.

247
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:26,690
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

248
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:26,690
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

249
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:34,530
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

250
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:34,530
like the descent of a god.
